=== TEST OPERATOR BITWISE ===
a = 15 (0x0F, biner: 00001111)
b = 85 (0x55, biner: 01010101)
a & b  = 5 (0x05, biner: 00000101)
a | b  = 95 (0x5F, biner: 01011111)
a ^ b  = 90 (0x5A, biner: 01011010)
~a     = -16 (komplemen dari 0x0F)
a << 2 = 60 (0x3C, biner: 00111100)
b >> 2 = 21 (0x15, biner: 00010101)

=== ASSIGNMENT BITWISE ===
x awal = 15
x &= 0x05 -> 5
x |= 0xA0 -> 165
x ^= 0xFF -> 90
x <<= 1 -> 180
x >>= 2 -> 45

=== MANIPULASI FLAG ===
Set bit 2: 4
Set bit 4: 20
Bit 2 = 1
Clear bit 2: 16
Toggle bit 4: 0
